{
  "name": "Charwell",
  "category": "Landing pages",
  "kind": "template",
  "summary": "A website for a modern grill restaurant: menu, table booking with a live seat map, online order and events",
  "about": "A seven-page website for an oak and charcoal grill on a harbour street, in charcoal and ember orange on cream. The home page opens on a slow reel of dish photos with embers drifting up through it, and menu prices count up whenever you change a filter. Guests can book a table on a live floor plan, order for pickup or delivery from a cart drawer, plan a private event and leave a review.",
  "how": [
    "Open a page from the top bar: Menu, Book, Order, Events, Reviews or Visit (on a phone, use the bar at the bottom)",
    "Filter the menu by section, vegetarian, spicy, sharing or gluten-free and watch the prices count up; tap a dish for details",
    "Book a table: pick a day, guests and a time, then tap a free table on the live floor plan and confirm with your details",
    "Order online for pickup or delivery, try the code EMBER10, and place the order to see it move through the grill",
    "Plan a private event: choose a space, a free date and a set menu, and the estimate updates as you change the guest count",
    "Write a review, read the FAQ and directions, and press Ctrl+K to search dishes and pages",
    "Reset demo data from the footer to bring back the starting bag, bookings and reviews"
  ],
